## Output
Answer with JSON only, on one line, without line breaks or tabs.
{% if tutor_query %}
The tutor asked you something. Answer it directly in "reply", based only on the evidence above. Add new suggestions only when the tutor asks for them or when the current suggestions no longer fit the discussion.
{"reply": "your answer to the tutor", "suggestions": "<ul><li>suggestion 1</li><li>suggestion 2</li><li>suggestion 3</li></ul>"}
or, without new suggestions:
{"reply": "your answer to the tutor"}
{% else %}
{"suggestions": "<ul><li>suggestion 1</li><li>suggestion 2</li><li>suggestion 3</li></ul>"}
{% endif %}

Rules for suggestions:
- Give three suggestions. Give fewer only when there are fewer useful ones; if there is none, say so in a single list item.
- Each suggestion is one short sentence that tells the tutor what to do, for example "Ask the student to …" or "Have the student compare …".
- Each suggestion targets a different problem or step.
